Z||000004||2birds||01-12-2000||09:55 PM||||Don't take this the wrong way, but some of you almost seem offended by a common topic re-appearing now and then.  Sure, not everybody knows how to use the search function, but sometimes the answer just isn't in an old thread.  Not everybody checks the board every day, and sometimes you can get some new ideas with a fresh post on an old topic.  New products/techniques/experiences, especially as the membership grows.||||reg||3
